**Given:**

a = frac{{2 - sqrt 5 }}{{2 + sqrt 5 }}

b = frac{{2 + sqrt 5 }}{{2 - sqrt 5 }}

**Formula Used: **

a² – b² = (a + b) (a – b)

(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab

(a – b)² = a² + b² – 2ab

**Calculation:**

a + b = frac{{2 - sqrt 5 }}{{2 + sqrt 5 }} + frac{{2 + sqrt 5 }}{{2 - sqrt 5 }}

⇒ a + b = frac{{{{( {2 - sqrt 5 } )}²} + {{( {2 + sqrt 5 } )}²}}}{{( {2 + sqrt 5 } )( {2 - sqrt 5 } )}}

⇒ a + b = frac{{4 + 5 - 4sqrt 5 + 4 + 5 + 4sqrt 5 }}{{4 - 5}}

⇒ a + b = 18/(–1)

⇒ a + b = (–18)

a – b = frac{{2 - sqrt 5 }}{{2 + sqrt 5 }} – frac{{2 + sqrt 5 }}{{2 - sqrt 5 }}

⇒ a – b = frac{{{{( {2 - sqrt 5 } )}²} - {{( {2 + sqrt 5 } )}²}}}{{( {2 + sqrt 5 } )( {2 - sqrt 5 } )}}

⇒ a – b = frac{{4 + 5 - 4sqrt 5 - ( {4 + 5 + 4sqrt 5 } )}}{{4 - 5}}

⇒ a – b = (–8√ 5 )/(–1)

⇒ a – b = 8√ 5 

a² – b² = (–18) × (8√5)

⇒ a² – b² = (–144√5)

**∴ The value of a² – b² is –144√5**
